; ============================================================
; Tic-Tac-Toe  —  STELLAR terminal game  (loads at $4000, VM1)
; VERSION:  v04  (2026-07-07) — indexed ops ($2E READIDX / $2F WRITEIDX)
; ============================================================
; Builds on v03. Collapses all 6 board accesses (5 reads + the two
; mark writes) from the ~8-13 byte COPYXA/ADDAI/COPYAX/COPYIMXA
; address-build to a single 4-byte READIDX/WRITEIDX. Also removes the
; R6 address temp (READMOVE's read is now READIDX R4; both writes use
; the index directly). Loop bodies (SCANLINE/PICKEMPTY) run 3 fewer
; opcodes per pass. All 8 CALL targets recomputed for the shift.
;   code 720B (v03) -> 698B (v04).
; Needs firmware v0061.1E (READIDX/WRITEIDX + the 1D zero-extends).
; ============================================================

